WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Start with the part you can observe.

00:12.000 --> 00:24.000
Follow the relationship as it changes.

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
A silhouette is observable evidence; words such as elegant or aggressive are interpretations. Start with lines, masses and spacing you can point to.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
Observation: “the roofline slopes toward the rear.” Interpretation: “the shape looks fast.” Keep those claims separate.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Observation sort

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
A view can support interpretation; it cannot prove hidden structure or compliance by itself.

